<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-1/2 (FIM 260.50).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-1/2 (FIM 260.50).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed down $1-1/8 at $56-1/2 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 260.50 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Thursday, Nokia A closed down 2.80 markka at 264.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) ended up $0-1/4 at $35 on Wall Street on Thursday. The price equals about 80.70 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 1.00 markka at 80.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed flat at $20-1/2 in New York on Thursday. The price corresponds to about 94.50 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki, Rauma closed down 1.00 markka at 96.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
